"HCF-LCM", "sub": "hcf-lcm-of-numbers", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 45, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Trigonometry", "sub": "complementary-angles", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 46, "text": "At a construction site, Raju can paint a wall in 36 hours, while Angad can do the same work in 18 hours. Sumit can paint the same wall in 24 hours. In how much time can they paint the wall if they all work together?", "options": [{"text": "9 hours", "added": false}, {"text": "12 hours", "added": false}, {"text": "6 hours", "added": false}, {"text": "8 hours", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "together-apart", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 47, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "tan θ", "added": false}, {"text": "cosec θ", "added": false}, {"text": "sec θ", "added": false}, {"text": "1", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Trigonometry", "sub": "identities", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 48, "text": "In an election, a candidate secures 42% of the votes polled but is defeated by his only opponent by a majority of 3080 votes, because of 1400 invalid votes. The percentage of invalid votes is _______.", "options": [{"text": "5%", "added": false}, {"text": "3%", "added": false}, {"text": "4%", "added": false}, {"text": "6%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 49, "text": "A man borrowed Rs.50,000 from a bank at 10% per annum, compounded annually. At the end of every year, he pays Rs.15,000 as part payment of the loan and interest. How much does he still owe to the bank after three such instalments?", "options": [{"text": "Rs.16,900", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.15,800", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.15,200", "added": false}, {"text": "Rs.16,200", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Compound Interest", "sub": "ci-instalments", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 50, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "Coca-Cola", "added": false}, {"text": "Pepsi", "added": false}, {"text": "Fanta", "added": false}, {"text": "Sprite", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Data Interpretation", "sub": "table", "key_answer": null}]}